                <pb facs="0340" n="320" xml:id="pg320"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">1. <hi rendition="#italic">Records of Previous
                    Meetings</hi></p>
                <p>The Council approved the records of the 4th, 6th, 7th, 8th and 9th Meetings.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">2. <hi rendition="#italic">Report by the Deputies to the
                        Council</hi></p>
                <p>Mr. Vyshinski submitted a report by the Deputies on the progress of the
                    preparation of the draft treaties with Italy, Roumania, Bulgaria, Hungary and
                    Finland.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">3. <hi rendition="#italic">U.S. Delegation’s Proposal for the
                        Meeting of the Peace Conference</hi></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to continue the discussion of this
                    question at the next meeting.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">4. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting of the
                    Council</hi></p>
                <p>The Council <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to hold its next meeting at 11
                    a.m. on 10th May.</p>
